COVERAGE: 14 progress rows since 2026-09-09, 14 provider reading(s).
odds_backfill_progress is keyed by DATE, so a date mixing a paired sport with an
unpaired one reads as paired — this catches total failure per date, not per sport.
KNOWN CI SPEND IS A LOWER BOUND: only odds-backfill records its own credits, so
probes and one-off fills are NOT subtracted and UNEXPLAINED is an upper bound on
real leakage. Joined on completed_at (the run clock), never on date (the day
being backfilled) — a run today writes yesterday's row.
